WEBVTT

00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:04.680
Today we will explore repeated structure through weaving. Our work connects with

00:00:04.680 --> 00:00:06.920
selected artists and traditions in Ghana.

00:00:07.783 --> 00:00:13.344
Lay parallel paper strips on a desk as the base. Name a design choice that a selected

00:00:13.344 --> 00:00:14.653
Ghanaian artist might make.

00:00:15.533 --> 00:00:17.965
Pass one strip over then under the base strips.

00:00:19.533 --> 00:00:22.307
Repeat the sequence and straighten the finished pattern.
